#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:9
msgid "Polymarket — Prediction Market Data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:11
msgid ""
"Query prediction market data from Polymarket using their public REST "
"APIs. All endpoints are read-only and require zero authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:14
msgid ""
"See `references/api-endpoints.md` for the full endpoint reference with "
"curl examples."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:16
msgid "When to Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:18
msgid "User asks about prediction markets, betting odds, or event probabilities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:19
msgid "User wants to know \"what are the odds of X happening?\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:20
msgid "User asks about Polymarket specifically"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:21
msgid "User wants market prices, orderbook data, or price history"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:22
msgid "User asks to monitor or track prediction market movements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:24
msgid "Key Concepts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:26
msgid "**Events** contain one or more **Markets** (1:many relationship)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:27
msgid "**Markets** are binary outcomes with Yes/No prices between 0.00 and 1.00"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:28
#, python-format
msgid "Prices ARE probabilities: price 0.65 means the market thinks 65% likely"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:29
msgid "`outcomePrices` field: JSON-encoded array like `[\"0.80\", \"0.20\"]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:30
msgid ""
"`clobTokenIds` field: JSON-encoded array of two token IDs [Yes, No] for "
"price/book queries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:31
msgid "`conditionId` field: hex string used for price history queries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:32
msgid "Volume is in USDC (US dollars)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:34
msgid "Three Public APIs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:36
msgid "**Gamma API** at `gamma-api.polymarket.com` — Discovery, search, browsing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:37
msgid ""
"**CLOB API** at `clob.polymarket.com` — Real-time prices, orderbooks, "
"history"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:38
msgid "**Data API** at `data-api.polymarket.com` — Trades, open interest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:40
msgid "Typical Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:42
msgid "When a user asks about prediction market odds:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:44
msgid "**Search** using the Gamma API public-search endpoint with their query"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:45
msgid "**Parse** the response — extract events and their nested markets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:46
msgid "**Present** market question, current prices as percentages, and volume"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:47
msgid ""
"**Deep dive** if asked — use clobTokenIds for orderbook, conditionId for "
"history"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:49
msgid "Presenting Results"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:51
msgid "Format prices as percentages for readability:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:52
msgid "outcomePrices `[\"0.652\", \"0.348\"]` becomes \"Yes: 65.2%, No: 34.8%\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:53
msgid "Always show the market question and probability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:54
msgid "Include volume when available"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:56
msgid "Example: `\"Will X happen?\" — 65.2% Yes ($1.2M volume)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:58
msgid "Parsing Double-Encoded Fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:60
msgid ""
"The Gamma API returns `outcomePrices`, `outcomes`, and `clobTokenIds` as "
"JSON strings inside JSON responses (double-encoded). When processing with"
" Python, parse them with `json.loads(market['outcomePrices'])` to get the"
" actual array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:64
msgid "Rate Limits"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:66
msgid "Generous — unlikely to hit for normal usage:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:67
msgid "Gamma: 4,000 requests per 10 seconds (general)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:68
msgid "CLOB: 9,000 requests per 10 seconds (general)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:69
msgid "Data: 1,000 requests per 10 seconds (general)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:71
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:73
msgid "This skill is read-only — it does not support placing trades"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:74
msgid "Trading requires wallet-based crypto authentication (EIP-712 signatures)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:75
msgid "Some new markets may have empty price history"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/polymarket_SKILL.md:76
msgid ""
"Geographic restrictions apply to trading but read-only data is globally "
"accessible"
msgstr ""

